flowchart LR
  Runtime[Server, jobs, lobby, and bots] --> Services[Domain service methods]
  Services --> Adapter[Diesel async adapter]
  Adapter --> Pool[Bounded connection pool]
  Pool --> Postgres[(PostgreSQL)]
  Migrate[Migrate command] --> Adoption[Drizzle history adoption check]
  Adoption --> Diesel[Apply pending Diesel migrations]
  Diesel --> Postgres
